How hard would it be to add synonym lookup, i.e. all variants of a lujvo.
E.g., I looked up {ga'orgau} and got lots of results. Looking up
{ganlygansu} got nothing. I'd also like to see the expansion of a lujvo
into its gismu, since I don't know all the rafsi yet.
Even without those, though, it's great.

stevo

